  46:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****      (#) Program the required configuration through the following parameters:
  47:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          the pixel format, the blending factors, input alpha value, the window size
  48:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          and the image size using HAL_LTDC_ConfigLayer() function for foreground
  49:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          or/and background layer.
  50:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c **** 
  51:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****      (#) Optionally, configure and enable the CLUT using HAL_LTDC_ConfigCLUT() and
  52:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          HAL_LTDC_EnableCLUT functions.
  53:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c **** 
  54:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****      (#) Optionally, enable the Dither using HAL_LTDC_EnableDither().
  55:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c **** 
  56:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****      (#) Optionally, configure and enable the Color keying using HAL_LTDC_ConfigColorKeying()
  57:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          and HAL_LTDC_EnableColorKeying functions.
  58:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c **** 
  59:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****      (#) Optionally, configure LineInterrupt using HAL_LTDC_ProgramLineEvent()
  60:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          function
  61:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c **** 
  62:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****      (#) If needed, reconfigure and change the pixel format value, the alpha value
  63:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          value, the window size, the window position and the layer start address
  64:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          for foreground or/and background layer using respectively the following
  65:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          functions: HAL_LTDC_SetPixelFormat(), HAL_LTDC_SetAlpha(), HAL_LTDC_SetWindowSize(),
