  68:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****      (#) Variant functions with _NoReload suffix allows to set the LTDC configuration/settings with
  69:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          This is useful in case when the program requires to modify serval LTDC settings (on one or
  70:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          then applying(reload) these settings in one shot by calling the function HAL_LTDC_Reload()
  71:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c **** 
  72:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          After calling the _NoReload functions to set different color/format/layer settings,
  73:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          the program shall call the function HAL_LTDC_Reload() to apply(reload) these settings.
  74:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          Function HAL_LTDC_Reload() can be called with the parameter ReloadType set to LTDC_RELOAD_
  75:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          an immediate reload is required.
  76:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          Function HAL_LTDC_Reload() can be called with the parameter ReloadType set to LTDC_RELOAD_
  77:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          the reload should be done in the next vertical blanking period,
  78:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****          this option allows to avoid display flicker by applying the new settings during the vertic
  79:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c **** 
