  88:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****       (+) __HAL_LTDC_ENABLE: Enable the LTDC.
  89:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****       (+) __HAL_LTDC_DISABLE: Disable the LTDC.
