  91:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****       (+) __HAL_LTDC_LAYER_DISABLE: Disable an LTDC Layer.
  92:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_ltdc.c ****       (+) __HAL_LTDC_RELOAD_IMMEDIATE_CONFIG: Reload  Layer Configuration.
